Whether or not decideTests() adds row names isn't actually specified in the documentation so,
strictly speaking, both behaviours are correct.  But it would be better to be consistent.  So I'll
update "heirarchical" and "nestedF" to preserve row names when this is possible.

Best wishes
Gordon


