From: tchiang at fhcrc.org (Tony Chiang)
Date: Thu, 22 Jun 2006 12:16:27 -0700 (PDT)
Subject: [BioC] In silico interactomes
In-Reply-To: <Pine.LNX.4.64.0606221721170.23210@localhost>
References: <C0BEF4F3.D266%sdavis2@mail.nih.gov>
